---
title: Device authorisation grant
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant CLI as Device CLI
    participant Auth@{ "type": "boundary", "alias": "Auth server" }
    participant Store@{ "type": "database" } as Token store

    User->>CLI: merlion login
    CLI->>+Auth: POST /device/code
    Auth-->>-CLI: user_code, verification_uri, interval=5s
    Note over User,CLI: The CLI prints the code and waits

    User->>Auth: Opens the verification page and approves
    loop Every 5s until approved or expired
        CLI->>+Auth: POST /token (grant_type=device_code)
        alt still pending
            Auth-->>CLI: 400 authorization_pending
        else approved
            Auth->>+Store: Persist refresh token
            Store-->>-Auth: ok
            Auth-->>-CLI: access_token, refresh_token
        end
    end
    CLI->>User: Signed in as user@example.com
